## Suggested build order

1. Supabase project + run the migration + set up auth
2. `app/(auth)` — login/signup pages
3. `app/(app)/courses` — CRUD + Kanban board (dnd-kit) with mock data
4. Wire real data via `lib/supabase` + `hooks/useCourses.ts`
5. `lib/ai/breakdownAssignment.ts` — first AI feature, easiest to demo
6. Repeat the pattern for Growth Mode
7. Career goal analysis + roadmap generation last (most complex prompt)
